---
title: Resources
layout: base.njk
---
<h1>Resources</h1>

<section>
  <h2>A typical meeting, at a glance</h2>
  <ol class="agenda-list">
    <li>Sergeant-at-Arms opens the meeting</li>
    <li>Toastmaster of the Day introduces the evening</li>
    <li>Prepared speeches, each followed by its Speech Evaluator</li>
    <li>Table Topics &mdash; impromptu speaking practice</li>
    <li>General Evaluation of the whole meeting</li>
    <li>Awards and close</li>
  </ol>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Meeting roles</h2>
  <p>{{ resources.meetingRolesIntro }}</p>
  <dl class="roles-list">
    {% for item in resources.meetingRoles %}
    <dt>{{ item.role }}</dt>
    <dd>{{ item.description }}</dd>
    {% endfor %}
  </dl>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Useful links</h2>
  <ul class="link-list">
    {% for link in resources.links %}
    <li>
      <a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.title }}</a>
      <p>{{ link.description }}</p>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
